Read(<a><![CDATA[x<y & z]]></a>) events: Start(a) Value[x<y & z] End(a)
Read(<a><![CDATA[<b>not a tag</b>]]></a>) events: Start(a) Value[<b>not a tag</b>] End(a)
Read(<a><![CDATA[&amp;]]></a>) events: Start(a) Value[&amp;] End(a)
Read(<a><![CDATA[]]></a>) events: Start(a) End(a)
Read(<a>p<![CDATA[<q>]]>r</a>) events: Start(a) Value[p<q>r] End(a)
Read(<a><![CDATA[a]b]]></a>) events: Start(a) Value[a]b] End(a)
Read(<a><![CDATA["quoted"]]></a>) events: Start(a) Value["quoted"] End(a)
